    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<color=#8f8f8f><i>'Alexandrina.'</i></color>",
        "x": 500,
        "y": 250,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 14,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Their voices have become clear."
    },
    {
        "text": "They are familiar and warm, as though they came from a forgotten corner of her memory."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how her name was called with scolding and love when she lingered too long in the garden."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<color=#9b9b9b><i>'Alexandrina.'</i></color>",
        "x": 50,
        "y": 150,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 16,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how her name was called with anxiety and urging when she sneaked out of the palace to see what was outside with curious eyes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<color=#e3e3e3><i>'Alexandrina.'</i></color>",
        "x": 600,
        "y": 220,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 18,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like how her name was called with pride and approval when she swung her little wooden sword, dreaming about becoming a warrior without equal."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "<color=#bfbfbf><i>'Alexandrina.'</i></color>",
        "x": 100,
        "y": 100,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 20,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is calling her like this?"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "The statues of the Aslan and Draco kings are displayed here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here is your grandfather, Frederick III, Conqueror of Gaul. By his side is his mother, Elizabeth the Glorious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "All in the procession begin treading lightly."
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She is searching. She knows it is fruitless, but her eyes cannot help but search."
    },
    {
        "text": "She stops before one of the statues."
    },
    {
        "text": "It was never finished, leaving behind only a rough silhouette."
    },
    {
        "text": "Chisel marks can be clearly seen, and an elaborate robe has yet to be liberated from the stone."
    },
    {
        "text": "Where the face should be, there is only a blur of rock with the slight hint of eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "The crown on the head hints at the statue's position."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "showall",
        "image": "32_g9_kingrest",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.5,
        "yScale": 1.5,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "fadetime": 0.85
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "By tradition, Originium Arts is not used in the creation of these statues. They are the result of years of hard work by royal sculptors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "His Majesty's passing was... sudden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "His Majesty's burden was heavy, politically and tangibly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "The empire was saddled with war debts, and the declining Draco hardly welcomed continued Aslan rule with open arms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how others might assess His Majesty, Father and I did not feel that he was inferior in any way to the kings who lie here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps, Allerdale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't remember.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe that's how he looked in my memories.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.5,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'Alexandrina'.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it him calling? Or all of them?"
    },
    {
        "text": "The statues do not look the same. Some of them look solemn, others look kind."
    },
    {
        "text": "She finds no image of them in her memory, but feels some kind of connection with them, deep down."
    },
    {
        "text": "The only ones who may style themselves Victoria are the monarchs of Victoria, and the heir to the throne."
    },
    {
        "text": "Therefore, she is Victoria, just like them."
    },
    {
        "text": "She looks away."
    },
    {
        "text": "Compared to vast and glorious Victoria, she is more familiar with the tiny taverns of Norport Borough, the scalding bitterness of cheap ale, and licking a sour lollipop after a fight."
    },
    {
        "text": "She turns away."
    },
    {
        "text": "In that moment, she spots a shadow behind the statues."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "To arms!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_attack_ready",
        "volume": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "They all grab their weapons."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like we found the ones who left the traces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz bodies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hundreds, if not more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Most have decomposed into skeletons, but their clothes tell us they were Sarkaz Royal Court elites, and Confessarius guards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frankly, the word 'elite' is an understatement. A fight with any one of them would be a desperate struggle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Who were they fighting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "She feels Allerdale's breath grow heavy."
    },
    {
        "text": "Bronze continues to glitter in the shadows of the corpses."
    },
    {
        "text": "Even history could not rob them of their color."
    },
    {
        "text": "She keeps moving forward."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
