    },
    {
        "text": "The knights of the empire never back down."
    },
    {
        "text": "One after another."
    },
    {
        "text": "Swords, fire, corrosive Arts. An entire suit of armor is covered in dried blood."
    },
    {
        "text": "Arts-imbued pila over five meters in length impaled their torsos."
    },
    {
        "text": "They kept formation, they fought on."
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing could defeat them. Not the Royal Court, not the Confessarii."
    },
    {
        "text": "Not even death."
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, she understands."
    },
    {
        "text": "She understands why the sound of steam has not been heard in Londinium for the past four years."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
