    },
    {
        "text": "Allerdale stumbles. Siege extends an arm to hold her friend.."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. It's just the air.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I think back to the steam armor of Cumberland Manor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "They were always defending, no matter the cost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They were... Steam Knights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "They carried the glorious banner of Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#6$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
