    },
    {
        "text": "*Sob*... *sob*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The suits of armor remain silent around them."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "showall",
        "image": "32_g9_kingrest",
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.5,
        "yScale": 1.5,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness02_intro",
        "key": "$darkness02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look nervous, Allerdale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Do I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wonder... how do you feel about the Steam Knights?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "They couldn't stop what happened twenty-six years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know, and I don't really care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#7$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But someone by the name of Gawain told me that there were no Steam Knights in Londinium at the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#7$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Parliament sent them away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "But they did nothing when they returned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think, then, Allerdale?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can tell you really revere the Steam Knights.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Revere? I don't know if I can say that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just thinking... Sir Charles Lynch was the last Steam Knight to be knighted during His Majesty's reign.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "There were no new Steam Knights in the two decades following.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it a warning? Or the price of a struggle that no one knows about? Did the dukes have their blades pointed at each other's throats?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps the betrayal had already started by then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't imagine what kind of slow death it must have been.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria killed itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "The voices mutter in protest."
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege pretends not to hear, and repeats calmly, but strongly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria killed itself with its own greed, ambition and desire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you wipe the slate clean, Your Royal Highness Alexandrina?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#4$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#6$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "The voices fall silent. They are waiting for an answer too."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll do what I must.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
